\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please keep in mind that this game was developed by one person so, while it is small, you should find that it is also very sweet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you enjoy Timeless Rain when it releases on March 31st!</p>","developers":["Young Cat Games Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401350/618d9b455772860b6890210c841e3bc621db6478/header.jpg?t=1771379035","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2401350/1479592818/62b2b3fe5887a3d5c50bbfa17fcfa30d67e0d514/1755574573/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755628252","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2401350/1479592818/62b2b3fe5887a3d5c50bbfa17fcfa30d67e0d514/1755574573/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755628252","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2401350/1479592818/62b2b3fe5887a3d5c50bbfa17fcfa30d67e0d514/1755574573/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755628252","id":257185221,"name":"Timeless Rain Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185221/edbb3b0df84a6f461f14ce93ff1cb1e183f34a6a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755628252"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2401350/679495/aab74b5b98445fed562cff64701c7bbabdbbd766/1750915368/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755634222","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2401350/679495/aab74b5b98445fed562cff64701c7bbabdbbd766/1750915368/dash_h264.mpd?t=